      "text": "Types of API\n    - REST - Representational State Transfer\n    - SOAP -XMLs\n    - GRAPHQL - Tells the Client What Exactly need to fetched\n    - GRPC - Remote procedure call\n    - Web Socket -  Communication that is intiated by the backend\n    - WebHooks  ",
