      "text": "400- Bad Request/Invalid Request\n401 - UnAutherized Error\n403- Forbidden Authenticated but doesn't have permission\n404- Not Found(Resource Doesn't exist)\n409 -  Request Conflict\n422 - Request Format is valid but data fails sematic validation\n429 - Rate Limiting Error \n\n\n\n\n\n",
